WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:07.382
It's good.

00:00:07.465 --> 00:00:09.467
Just try a bite.

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:18.018
Oh, this? You use it like this.

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:22.022
Hey, no messing around at the table.

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.649
Sorry.

00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:34.034
This is not some scheme to poison me,
is it?

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:36.828
You don't have to eat it
if you don't want to.

00:00:41.124 --> 00:00:44.127
When in Rome, do as the Romans do.

00:01:02.979 --> 00:01:06.524
-Don't push yourself.
-Water?

00:01:09.152 --> 00:01:12.989
"My. Such a strange flavor

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:15.533
but the spices and hidden sweetness

00:01:15.617 --> 00:01:18.995
blend together in perfect harmony
inside my mouth."

00:01:19.496 --> 00:01:23.917
"Oh! I can feel my body fill with energy!"

00:01:23.958 --> 00:01:25.543
Yes, yes, yes!

00:01:25.627 --> 00:01:27.921
That was "When the Samurai eats Curry."

00:01:28.004 --> 00:01:28.922
Koharu!

00:01:30.965 --> 00:01:32.884
Do you actually like it?

00:01:33.551 --> 00:01:35.512
It seems like it.

00:01:38.807 --> 00:01:40.016
What is that?

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:42.727
Hot spices. Would you like some?

00:01:46.022 --> 00:01:47.107
There.

00:01:48.608 --> 00:01:50.819
You put more on yours.

00:01:50.902 --> 00:01:54.656
It's better for beginners
to start with this amount.

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:56.282
Your concern is unnecessary.

00:02:03.665 --> 00:02:07.127
A true warrior fears nothing.

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:09.129
Don't say I didn't warn you.

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:14.843
Much gratitude.

00:02:29.858 --> 00:02:33.069
-That's why I told you not to!
-Water! Water!

00:02:34.696 --> 00:02:36.531
That wasn't so bad.

00:02:36.614 --> 00:02:37.991
Look at your lips!

00:02:38.074 --> 00:02:39.325
They're bright red!

